  "description": "Template-based report generation for .NET 10 using Syncfusion File Formats (OpenXML compliant). Supports Excel (XlsIO), Word (DocIO), PowerPoint (Presentation) templates with MailMerge / template markers / placeholder replacement, native chart generation, and PDF conversion. Templates are loaded from Cayaqui.Storage. Proprietary — requires a commercial agreement with Cayaqui.",
